  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco has redesigned the classic base layer t-shirt for a full and comfortable fit. The Comfort Fit T-shirt features an extended sleeve length, shoulder width, and overall length allowing for unencumbered movement, making it ideal for work, outdoor activities, or even lounging. The superior soft yet rugged t-shirt is made of a combed 5oz ring-spun cotton/poly blend that is ready to work for you. The inset collar with taped seams at the back of the neck and double-stitched shoulder seams offer you long-lasting comfort and durability.&nbsp;</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133321",
  "description": "<p>Rothco's Full Comfort Fit T-Shirt offers unbeatable comfort with room to move. Rothco has redesigned the classic base layer t-shirt for a full and comfortable fit. The Comfort Fit T-shirt features an extended sleeve length, shoulder width, and overall length allowing for unencumbered movement, making it ideal for work, outdoor activities, or even lounging. The superior soft yet rugged t-shirt is made of a combed 5oz ring-spun cotton/polyester blend that is ready to work for you. The inset collar with taped seams at the back of the neck and double-stitched shoulder seams offer you the long-lasting comfort and trusted durability you&rsquo;ve come to know from Rothco.&nbsp;</p>",
